ourse_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"链栈","aliases":[],"type":"concept","definition":"采用链式存储的栈，通常用不带头结点的单链表实现，规定所有操作都在表头进行，表头指针就是栈顶指针。","level":0,"confidence":0.95,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_5368b6fd341d0573cb014b738acd1b9f","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"下溢","aliases":[],"type":"concept","definition":"对空栈执行出栈则发生下溢。","level":0,"confidence":0.9,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_54ab0305ca46321ed6922ed0fe4c4580","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"顺序栈的入栈与出栈操作","aliases":[],"type":"method","definition":"入栈时先令 top 加 1 再写入元素，出栈时先读出元素再令 top 减 1。","level":0,"confidence":0.9,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_5fa667e070f433ecd1862b7f6f288678","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"栈","aliases":[],"type":"concept","definition":"栈（又称堆栈，英文 stack）是只允许在一端进行插入和删除操作的线性表。","level":0,"confidence":0.95,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_61848f2a0a4507909777e9a89ce73272","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"括号匹配算法","aliases":[],"type":"method","definition":"基于栈的后进先出特性实现的匹配检查方法：从左到右扫描表达式，遇到左括号就入栈；遇到右括号时，若栈为空或栈顶的左括号与之类型不符，则匹配失败，否则弹出栈顶；扫描结束后栈为空，才表示所有括号都匹配成功。","level":0,"confidence":0.9,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_61e0abec8c7ad78f2615c7347e090873","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"阶乘的递归计算","aliases":[],"type":"example","definition":"计算 3! 的实例：fact(3) 调用 fact(2)，fact(2) 调用 fact(1)，递归工作栈中依次压入三层记录，fact(1) 返回 1 后逐层弹出，依次得到 fact(2) = 2 和 fact(3) = 6。","level":0,"confidence":0.85,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_63b4b3bd7daa992c07edf659c7573018","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"后缀表达式","aliases":[],"type":"concept","definition":"把运算符放在两个操作数之后的写法，也叫逆波兰式，不含括号，计算次序完全由运算符出现的位置决定，适合计算机处理。","level":0,"confidence":0.95,"status":"draft","source":"a