","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_c271a8b5908726ed231473e9c9a3181e","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"递归转非递归","aliases":[],"type":"method","definition":"借助显式的栈保存待处理的状态，把递归算法改写为非递归算法，这种做法称为递归转非递归。","level":0,"confidence":0.9,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_cddfe0d2b6c5f138c5d7fdf1c1e1eba9","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"区分队空与队满的方法","aliases":[],"type":"method","definition":"牺牲一个存储单元是为了区分队空和队满这两种状态；也可以改用计数变量 size 来区分。","level":0,"confidence":0.85,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_d2ad6652eff5bd1d38ec3b1346819870","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"栈与队列","aliases":[],"type":"concept","definition":"栈和队列是两种操作受限的线性表，可以用线性表的顺序存储与链式存储结构来实现。","level":0,"confidence":0.9,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_d3b44fe7cd5d13ed231185b13a6b4f4e","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"链队列不产生假溢出","aliases":[],"type":"theorem","definition":"链队列不会产生假溢出，也不需要预先确定容量，适合元素个数变化较大的场合。","level":0,"confidence":0.75,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_d9b941691ec8339759199e08d208f656","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"指针回绕与取模运算","aliases":[],"type":"concept","definition":"循环队列中指针的回绕完全依靠取模运算实现，因此理解循环队列需要先掌握取模运算。","level":0,"confidence":0.85,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_d9c7b0c1dfd79266b3b402f02e68227a","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"顺序栈的主要缺点","aliases":[],"type":"theorem","definition":"上溢说明预分配的空间不足，这是顺序栈的主要缺点。","level":0,"confidence":0.85,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_dc1747f382fd6ee5bd9ab1e7a3445b01","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"双端队列退化为栈的条件","aliases":[],"type":"theorem","definition":"若限制双端队列只在一端进行插入和删除，则它退化为栈。","level":0,"confidence":0.85,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_e3b582eaa863d43853d96c74e4943c9f","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"出栈序列计数定理","aliases":[],"type":"theorem","definition":"定理 3.1：n 个不同元素依次入栈，可能得到的不同出栈序列的个数等于第 n 个卡特兰数。","level":0,"confidence":0.85,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_e692c4bbd88de378583c652ea8d5b7d1","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"空栈","aliases":[],"type":"concept","definition":"不含任何元素的栈称为空栈。","level":0,"confidence":0.9,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_e8920e4e7cbf483ce44354c5a026f70d","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"栈顶与栈底","aliases":[],"type":"concept","definition":"栈中允许进行插入和删除操作的一端称为栈顶，另一端称为栈底。","level":0,"confidence":0.8,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_f169d9cd662141ecf9a0b0243147f743","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"合法出栈序列判定","aliases":[],"type":"theorem","definition":"性质 3.1：排列 p1 p2 … pn 是合法出栈序列，当且仅当不存在下标 i < j < k 使得 pj < pk < pi；即若某个较大元素先出栈，则比它小且仍在栈中的元素必须按从大到小的顺序出栈。","level":0,"confidence":0.9,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_f1cc25157dcf489a9e7bbef76ca9398e","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"出栈序列判断实例","aliases":[],"type":"example","definition":"元素 1、2、3 依次入栈时判断 3 1 2 是否为合法出栈序列：3 最先出栈说明 1 和 2 都在栈中且 2 在 1 之上，下一个出栈的只能是 2 而不能是 1，故 3 1 2 不合法；按性质 3.1 取 i = 1、j = 2、k = 3 也得同样结论。","level":0,"confidence":0.85,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_f4a563803dce153706b91843d72da4d6","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"队列的插入删除位置与先进先出","aliases":[],"type":"concept","definition":"队列的插入和删除分别在两端完成，因此最早到达的元素总是最先被处理。","level":0,"confidence":0.9,"status":"draft","source":"ai","locked":false,"revision":1},{"id":"kp_f5e9ae17648df1d3308aa6b85a741a1c","course_id":"242a2f6b052e4c7a8466058800f77bc6","name":"共享栈","aliases":[],"type":"concept","definition":"为让两个栈共享同一个数组、提高空间利用率，两个栈底分别设在数组两端，栈顶相向增长，这种结构称为共享栈。","level